Description: Ghosts of Mars, 4k intro by Faemiyah (Assembly 2015)
 Ghosts of Mars is a 4k intro released by Faemiyah at Assembly 2015, where
 it ranked 4th in the combined 4k intro compo. The original party version
 ran on FreeBSD.
 .
 This package contains the regular (non-compressed) build of the intro,
 compiled from the sources with the system libraries. Press F to toggle
 fullscreen and Esc to quit.
 .
 Synth & music:              Juippi
 Everything else:            Trilkk
 Additional everything else: Warma
